+## Saved versus effective Max IOB
+
+Low Glucose Suspend and Basal Testing derive effective Max IOB 0 while retaining the saved preference. Basal Testing additionally changes effective sensitivity settings. These mode constraints do not establish a universal limit for every manual bolus entry path. See [Dosing Modes](../closed-loop.md) and the [calculator safety gates](../../../usage/features/bolus-calculator.md#recommendation-safety-gates).
+
+The Max Bolus picker accepts 0.5–30 U in 0.5 U steps in `DecimalPickerSettings.swift`; available pump-specific settings and rounding can impose further constraints.
+
